The 12-page sample deck ships with published research figures from
Yuan, Chen, Wang & Sun (2025), *Information Systems Research* 36(1): 84-106,
DOI 10.1287/isre.2022.0294. Those numbers belong to their authors; the sample
exists to demonstrate the layout system could carry real evidence.
